# ── FORMATO: accion (figura moviendose en el espacio) ─────────────────────
# CORREGIDO 2026-08-29 tras comparar la MISMA region toma a toma: el sujeto
# saltaba de sitio y de escala en cada corte —toma 1 al borde izquierdo casi
# fuera de cuadro, toma 2 centrado y grande, toma 3 mucho mas abajo—. Con camara
# fija eso es un salto de continuidad en cada enlace, y ninguna metrica lo vio.
#
# La causa: cada toma pedia una accion distinta sin decir DONDE queda el sujeto,
# asi que el modelo lo recomponia a su gusto. Ahora las cuatro fijan la misma
# posicion y el mismo tamaño en cuadro, y solo cambia lo que hace alli.
@TIPO accion
@ESCENA A dim study at dusk lit only by a warm desk lamp on a wooden table, tall bookshelves behind, a window showing deep blue evening sky. A man of about fifty-five with a full soft salt-and-pepper beard, in a charcoal grey wool sweater, stands at the table on the LEFT THIRD of the frame, seen from the waist up, the same distance from the camera throughout.
@AMBIENTE A quiet room tone with the faint hum of a distant street beyond the window, and the soft creak of old wood.
@MUSICA A sparse low sustained cello note held quietly, restrained and continuous, unchanging in character.

TOMA|He stands at the table in the left third of the frame and looks down at the open book.|inicio|
TOMA|Still in the left third of the frame, at the same distance, he rests one hand on the table.|ancla|
TOMA|Still in the left third of the frame, at the same distance, he turns his head slowly toward the window.|ancla|
TOMA|Still in the left third of the frame, at the same distance, he looks back down at the book.|ancla|
TOMA|Still in the left third of the frame, at the same distance, he leans in slightly over the page.|ancla|
TOMA|Still in the left third of the frame, at the same distance, he straightens up and stands still.|ancla|
TOMA|Still in the left third of the frame, at the same distance, he rests both hands on the table edge.|ancla|
